{
  "schema_version": 3,
  "directory_contract": {
    "data": "agent-maintained rules and reference material",
    "output": "current validated handoff for downstream agents (stable names, no version suffix) plus manifest.json",
    "artifacts": "immutable per-run history; deliverables saved as 名称-YYYYMMDD_NN.ext"
  },
  "naming_contract": "上游 00-03 用数字前缀=层号（最长上游链长度）。从尺码计算起按最终产物分线：A 全量表、B TRIM适配器、C 代表车型、D 发货单、X 旁路分析；A0 尺码计算是各线共用枢纽，线内序号自 1 递增，且大于线内上游的序号。",
  "release_contract": "python scripts/publish_release.py 自上游到下游发布：artifact 内交付物带 -YYYYMMDD_NN 后缀，发布到 output/ 时去掉后缀，manifest.json 记录交付物 sha256、artifact 来源与上游版本；根目录 release.json 汇总。outputs 只列已存在的稳定交付物，未产出的写入 pending。",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "dimension-crawler",
      "path": "00.自动化尺寸抓取器",
      "layer": 0,
      "line": "U",
      "role": "upstream",
      "upstream": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "pending": [
        "区域尺寸抓取候选"
      ],
      "release_notes": [
        "抓取产物目前只保存在 artifacts，尚无稳定 output"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dimension-library",
      "path": "01.整理尺寸库",
      "layer": 1,
      "line": "U",
      "role": "upstream",
      "upstream": [
        "dimension-crawler"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "尺寸库.csv",
        "尺寸库_US.csv",
        "尺寸库_EU.csv",
        "尺寸库_RU.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "id": "structure-review",
      "path": "02.分类结构审核",
      "layer": 2,
      "line": "U",
      "role": "upstream",
      "upstream": [
        "dimension-library"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "车型结构.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sales-estimation",
      "path": "02.销量评估",
      "layer": 2,
      "line": "U",
      "role": "upstream",
      "upstream": [
        "dimension-library"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "原子销量.csv"
      ],
      "pending": [],
      "release_notes": [
        "原子销量已从找回的 atom_sales.csv 校验后按稳定文件名发布"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "code-mapping",
      "path": "02.代码映射",
      "layer": 2,
      "line": "U",
      "role": "upstream",
      "upstream": [
        "dimension-library"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "车型编码映射.csv",
        "尺寸编码映射.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "id": "shape-classification",
      "path": "03.车形分类核定",
      "layer": 3,
      "line": "U",
      "role": "upstream",
      "upstream": [
        "dimension-library",
        "structure-review"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "车形分类.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "id": "size-calculation",
      "path": "A0.尺码计算",
      "layer": 4,
      "line": "A",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "final",
      "upstream": [
        "dimension-library",
        "shape-classification",
        "sales-estimation",
        "code-mapping"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "全量表_US.csv",
        "全量表_EU.csv",
        "全量表_RU.csv",
        "尺寸分析表_US.csv",
        "店铺全量_HNT.csv",
        "店铺全量_TM.csv",
        "店铺全量_TM_拆分.csv",
        "尺码匹配规则.csv",
        "尺码匹配规则_EU.csv",
        "尺码匹配规则_RU.csv",
        "店铺货架.csv",
        "尺码匹配报告_EU.json",
        "尺码匹配报告_US.json",
        "尺码匹配报告_RU.json"
      ],
      "pending": [],
      "release_notes": [
        "US 已使用正式发布的原子销量重算；RU 使用 Auto.ru 在售样本代理销量并以覆盖候选补齐车形；EU 已覆盖全尺寸库的车形与尺码候选，但销量为零占位，均需后续质量研究复核"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "full-table-summary",
      "path": "A1.全量汇总",
      "layer": 5,
      "line": "A",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "final",
      "upstream": [
        "size-calculation"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "全量表_汇总.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "id": "adapter-trim",
      "path": "B1.适配器-Trim生成",
      "layer": 5,
      "line": "B",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "final",
      "upstream": [
        "size-calculation"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "TRIM适配器.csv",
        "尺寸TRIM映射.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "id": "representative-model",
      "path": "C1.车型代表分析",
      "layer": 5,
      "line": "C",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "final",
      "upstream": [
        "size-calculation"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "代表车型.csv",
        "代表车型.tsv",
        "代表车型报告.md"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sku-clustering",
      "path": "D1.聚类SKU",
      "layer": 5,
      "line": "D",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "upstream",
      "upstream": [
        "size-calculation",
        "sales-estimation"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "pending": [
        "SKU聚类结果"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "link-analysis",
      "path": "D2.链接分析",
      "layer": 6,
      "line": "D",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "final",
      "upstream": [
        "size-calculation",
        "sku-clustering",
        "sales-estimation"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "pending": [
        "发货单.csv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dimension-iteration",
      "path": "X1.尺寸迭代",
      "layer": 5,
      "line": "X",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "support",
      "upstream": [
        "dimension-library",
        "shape-classification",
        "size-calculation"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "pending": [
        "尺寸迭代候选"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "size-cluster-analysis",
      "path": "X2.尺码簇分析",
      "layer": 5,
      "line": "X",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "support",
      "upstream": [
        "size-calculation"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "尺码上限微调分析.xlsx",
        "边界负面影响及手动调整.xlsx"
      ],
      "pending": []
    }
  ],
  "final_products": [
    {
      "name": "全量表（US/RU）",
      "node": "size-calculation",
      "files": [
        "全量表_US.csv",
        "全量表_RU.csv",
        "全量表_EU.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "name": "全量表（汇总）",
      "node": "full-table-summary",
      "files": [
        "全量表_汇总.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "name": "TRIM适配器",
      "node": "adapter-trim",
      "files": [
        "TRIM适配器.csv"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "name": "代表车型报告",
      "node": "representative-model",
      "files": [
        "代表车型报告.md"
      ],
      "pending": []
    },
    {
      "name": "发货单",
      "node": "link-analysis",
      "files": [],
      "pending": [
        "发货单.csv"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
